        "date_posted": "2026-10-07T00:00:00+00:00",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "**WE ARE HIRING — AI WEB DEVELOPER**\n\nWe are looking for an **AI\\-Powered Web Developer / Full\\-Stack Developer** who has strong knowledge of modern web technologies and can confidently work with different programming languages, frameworks, APIs, and existing codebases.\n\nThe Ideal Candidate Should Have:\n\n* Strong **Full\\-Stack Web Development** experience\n* Excellent knowledge of **HTML, CSS, JavaScript \\& TypeScript**\n* Experience with **React, Next.js, Vue, Angular** or similar frameworks\n* Strong backend knowledge with **Node.js, PHP, Laravel, Python, Django, FastAPI** or equivalent technologies\n* Experience working with **MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis** and other databases\n* Ability to understand, modify, debug, and optimize **existing website code**\n* Experience developing **custom websites and web applications from scratch**\n* Strong knowledge of **REST APIs, third\\-party APIs and integrations**\n* Experience with **AI tools and AI\\-assisted coding**\n* Knowledge of integrating **OpenAI, Claude, AI APIs, AI Agents and automation tools**\n* Ability to use AI effectively for **coding, debugging, testing, optimization and development**\n* Understanding of **Git, GitHub, deployment, hosting, servers and cloud environments**\n* Knowledge of **Shopify, WooCommerce or other e\\-commerce technologies** is a plus\n* Ability to work with **legacy code and unfamiliar technologies**\n* Strong problem\\-solving and analytical skills\n\nAI Expertise\n\nThe candidate should know how to use AI as a **development partner**, not simply as a chatbot.\n\nYou should be able to use AI to:\n\n→ Generate and improve code  \n→ Debug complex issues  \n→ Understand unfamiliar codebases  \n→ Refactor and optimize existing code  \n→ Build features faster  \n→ Integrate AI APIs  \n→ Automate repetitive development tasks  \n→ Test and troubleshoot applications  \n→ Work across different programming languages and frameworks\n\n**What We Are Looking For**\n\nWe don't need someone who only knows one framework.\n\nWe need a **problem solver** who can receive an existing website or application, understand how it works, identify the technology behind it, work with its code, fix issues, add new features, and improve the overall system.\n\n**If you can work with different technologies and use AI intelligently to solve development problems — we want to hear from you.**\n\n**Apply Now**\n\nSend your **CV/Portfolio \\+ GitHub profile \\+ examples of your previous projects**.\n\n**Position:** AI Web Developer / Full\\-Stack Developer  \n**Experience:** \\[2\\+ / 3\\+ Years]  \n**Job Type:** \\[Full\\-Time / Part\\-Time / Remote]\n\nPay: Rs50,000\\.00 \\- Rs93,000\\.00 per month\n\nWork Location: In person",
