        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "**Full Stack Engineer — AI Systems \\& Automation** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Fixed Monthly Retainer \\| Remote** \n\n\n\n\n**Sectors:** \n Hospitality, Real Estate, Property Management\n \n\n\n\n**Start:** \n Immediate availability preferred\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The Firm\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n AIZ Business Consulta is a strategic consultancy based in Lisbon, serving businesses across European hospitality, real estate, and property management markets.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The Role\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We are expanding our engineering capacity to support concurrent client deployments and internal systems development. You will work across multiple active codebases alongside our strategy and operations teams, building modular systems designed for repeated deployment across our client base.\n \n\n\n\n This is a dedicated, long\\-term engagement with a fixed monthly retainer. Scope grows as the partnership matures.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Candidates who send a brief cover note to info@aizconsulta.com describing one AI or automation system they have built and deployed in production will receive priority consideration. Please include a link to your GitHub or professional portfolio.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Technical Scope\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Systems Architecture \\& Integration** \n\n\n\n* Multi\\-point API integration middleware — ingesting, normalizing, and routing data across heterogeneous third\\-party platforms with consistency and fault\\-tolerance guarantees\n* Payment and billing system integrations (Stripe, GoCardless, SEPA)\n* Messaging and communication automation across email, SMS, and WhatsApp Business API channels\n* Scheduling, calendar, and booking system orchestration\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**AI \\& Machine Learning** \n\n\n\n* Conversational AI systems with third\\-party API orchestration, real\\-time data retrieval, and context\\-aware response logic\n* LLM\\-powered endpoints for domain\\-specific analysis, document generation, and automated classification\n* Predictive modelling and statistical analysis pipelines using operational and market data\n* Autonomous and semi\\-autonomous AI agent development for workflow execution\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Web \\& Front\\-End** \n\n\n\n* Full\\-stack web applications (Next.js / TypeScript) with server\\-side rendering and structured data\n* Interactive dashboards and reporting interfaces for operational and financial data\n* Client\\-facing portal development with authentication and role\\-based access\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Internal Tooling** \n\n\n\n* MCP server architecture for automated data acquisition, enrichment, and pipeline ingestion\n* CRM integration and pipeline automation\n* Internal workflow tooling connecting proprietary systems with external SaaS platforms\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Requirements\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Non\\-Negotiable** \n\n\n\n* Strong proficiency in TypeScript (Next.js / Node.js) and Python\n* Production experience with LLM\\-based applications — deployed systems with real users, not prototypes or demos\n* Demonstrated ability to design and maintain multi\\-point API integrations where data consistency and error handling are critical\n* Self\\-directed work across parallel deliverables without daily oversight\n* Clear written and verbal communication — technical decisions will be explained to non\\-technical stakeholders regularly\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Strongly Preferred** \n\n\n\n* Experience with conversational AI or telephony platforms (Vapi, Bland AI, Retell AI, or equivalent)\n* Experience with CRM platforms and automation tooling (HubSpot, Pipedrive, Make, n8n)\n* Familiarity with web scraping frameworks (Apify, Playwright, BeautifulSoup)\n* Understanding of MCP (Model Context Protocol) server architecture\n* Working knowledge of SSR, technical SEO principles, and structured data markup\n* Experience with predictive modelling or statistical analysis (scikit\\-learn, TensorFlow, or equivalent)\n* Previous work in hospitality, real estate, or property management technology\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Engagement Terms\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You are compensated for availability and output across the month with a fixed retainer, not for individual deliverables. Scope grows as the partnership matures, and retainer level is discussed directly with shortlisted candidates based on experience and alignment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Shortlisted candidates should expect a multi\\-stage evaluation including a technical interview and a hands\\-on assessment task.",
